  "answer_text": "Here is the contact information for **Advance Auto Parts Human Resources**:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcde HR Phone Numbers:\n\n1. **540-362-4911** \u2014 This is the primary contact number to reach the HR department for employment-related inquiries.\n\n2. **1-800-380-4681** \u2014 This is the **HR Support Center** number for employees needing assistance.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udce7 HR Email:\nYou can also reach the HR Support Center via email at **HRSupportCenter@advance-auto.com**.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd50 Business Hours:\nWhen contacting Advance Auto Parts Human Resources, make sure to call during regular business hours. The HR department is typically available from **10:00 AM to 5:00 PM, Monday through Friday**, excluding public holidays.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udca1 Tips for Calling:\n- For optimal service and shorter wait times, it is recommended to call at around **11:30 AM**, as this time frame tends to have less call volume.\n- Have your information ready. If you are a current employee, provide your **employee ID**. If you are a job seeker, be prepared to mention the position you are applying for or the date you submitted your application.",
